## What to deliver

Composite the fortress up operation by operation until the mesh in `model.png`
matches the brief — a heavily armored citadel standing on six thick
articulated legs, a big main turret with a long forward cannon, a side turret out on
each sponson, and a sensor vane above, cleanly symmetric about its centerplane.
**Before you finish, run `mc render`** so the geometry (`mesh.glb`) the result is
built from is emitted — an unrendered model is scored as empty. When you are
satisfied, stop: the recorded operations are your finished submission.
